---
description: Instructions for updating documents
globs:
alwaysApply: false
---

### Postman collection

MUST update Postman collection when there's any change related to API Contract.

- If endpoint is private (that requires auth token), set Authorization header to `Bearer {{auth_token}}` for request.
- URL must be prefixed with `{{base_url}}`
- Include example request body for POST/PUT requests.
- Include all query parameters with descriptions.
- Set proper headers (Authorization, Content-Type).

### Swagger

- MUST update swagger comments and regenerate swagger docs when there's any change related to API Contract.
- To regenerate swagger docs, run `make docs`

## DB Schema

- MUST update file `docs/db.diagram` when there's any change related to model.
- `docs/db.diagram` content is dbdiagram.io format diagram.
